(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Habitats of animals.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising explaining why animals live where they do.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is a habitat?.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A habitat is the place where an animal lives. It gives the animal food, water, shelter and space to raise its young.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Different habitats.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "South Africa has many habitats, such as grasslands, forests, deserts, wetlands and the ocean.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Why do frogs live near ponds?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think about what a frog needs.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Frogs lay their eggs in water, and tadpoles live in water.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Frogs also catch insects that live near water. So a pond gives them water, food and a place to breed.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort the animals into their main habitat.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which animals need to live in water all the time?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The Kalahari is a desert.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Frogs and ducks live in or near ponds.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Dolphins and fish live in the ocean, gemsbok and meerkats in the desert, frogs and ducks in wetlands.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which of these does a habitat NOT need to give an animal?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A television": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Food": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Shelter": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Water": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think about what animals need to survive.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Food, water, shelter and space.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which one is a human object?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Animals need food, water, shelter and space. They do not need a television.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A wetland is drained to build houses. What will happen to the frogs?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "They lose their habitat and may die or move": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "They will live in the houses": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Nothing will change": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "They will learn to swim in the sea": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What do frogs need water for?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Where will they lay their eggs?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Without water, the habitat is gone.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The frogs lose the water they need, so they must move or they may die.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Why can a gemsbok survive in the Kalahari?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It can go a long time without drinking water": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It needs to swim every day": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It eats fish": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It sleeps in trees": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is scarce in a desert?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Desert animals are suited to dry places.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Gemsbok get much of their water from the plants they eat.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Gemsbok can survive a long time without drinking, which suits the dry Kalahari.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Why do different animals live in different habitats?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Each animal is suited to the place that meets its needs": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Animals choose by colour": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "All animals can live anywhere": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Habitats are chosen by people": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think about the frog and the gemsbok.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Their needs are different.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A habitat must give an animal what it needs.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Each animal's body and habits suit the habitat that gives it food, water and shelter.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What helped you understand habitats?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Thinking about what animals need": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Picturing the places": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Animals I have seen": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Protecting habitats protects the animals that live in them.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Habitat. the place where an animal lives.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Shelter. a safe place to hide or rest.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Wetland. land that is wet, like a marsh or pond.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
